---
import { navItems } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-main container">
    <a class="brand-lockup" href="/" aria-label="MOONWORLD 홈">
      <img src="/images/moonworld-logo.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="1200" height="323" />
    </a>
    <p>제조 현장을 이해하고, AI로 업무를 혁신합니다.</p>
    <a class="footer-email" href="mailto:contact@moonworld.uk">contact@moonworld.uk</a>
    <nav aria-label="푸터 메뉴">
      {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom container">
    <span>Manufacturing DX · Industrial AI · Engineering Automation</span>
    <a href="/contact/">프로젝트 상담 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</footer>
